<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xionics started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xionics started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it started coverage of Xionics Document Technologies Inc with short-term and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Set FY 1997 earnings estimate at $0.43 per share.</p>
<p>-- Set FY 1998 estimate at $0.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 15.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
